description	"Hutt Warrior

A buff slug with innate Strength and resistances, as well as a ground-quaking Bardiche.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 12% slower RoF
- Hutt Bardiche (Red Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Pushes/trips on surface hit
--- 130% larger splash
--- 25% more splash damage
--- 100% more splash knockback
-- 100% more knockback
-- 38% longer
-- 66% thicker

^8Attributes:
- Strength (3)
- Fury (3)
- Base Damage Taken
- Blast Armor
- Melee Resist
- Healing (1)
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)
- Rally
- Acid Blood
- 50% less knockback taken

^3Abilities:
- Toxic Laughter ^3[Taunt Jedi]
- Rage ^3[Melee CS1]
- Shoulder Barge (1) ^3[Melee CS2]"